BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:For more than 20 years\, The Hummin’ Birds have been bringing the spirit of early American music to life. Born out of Minnesota’s bluegrass and old-time scene\, Cami Harris and Mike Silbernagel honed their sound through late-night jams and festival campfires before winning first place in a 2006 Minnesota State Fair duet contest. Now based in Denver\, the duo shares their signature harmonies\, timeless song interpretations\, and heartfelt originals with audiences across the Front Range and Midwest.\nThis concert is part of the Longmont Museum’s Friday Afternoon Concert Series.  Enjoy an afternoon of live music in our Stewart Auditorium this fall featuring an eclectic array of musical acts from up and down the Front Range.\nLearn more and buy tickets online at https://longmontcolorado.gov/event/the-hummin-birds/ or by calling 303-651-8374.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/friday-afternoon-concert-the-hummin-birds
DTEND:20260410T223000Z
LOCATION:Longmont Museum
DTSTART:20260410T203000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Folk/Acoustic] Friday Afternoon Concert: The Hummin’ Birds
UID:739d427c-f2b7-45ec-ae57-dac01a51ac56@739d.org
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DESCRIPTION:The beloved children’s tale “The Story of Peter Rabbit” comes to life in the form of “Mini Música” —an interactive\, bilingual story time concert for young audiences ages 0 to 7. Featuring a 16-piece orchestra and a narrator who dances and sings in English and Spanish\, this program is designed to engage young children through a musical telling of a classic children’s story. As part of the Colorado Symphony’s commitment to early childhood education literacy initiatives\, all concert attendees will receive a complimentary bilingual storybook at each concert.\nLearn more and make free reservations online at https://longmontcolorado.gov/event/colorado-symphony-mini-musica-concert-the-story-of-peter-rabbit/ or by calling 303-651-8374.\n\nLink: https://www.downtownlongmont.com/do/colorado-symphony-mini-musica-concert-the-story-of-peter-rabbit-1
DTEND:20260404T183000Z
LOCATION:Longmont Museum
DTSTART:20260404T173000Z
SUMMARY:🎵 [Classical] Colorado Symphony Mini Música Concert: The Story of Peter Rabbit
UID:fc942f7c-75a1-4de2-b8b6-8c16dbce43d0@fc94.org
END:VEVENT
